>
  <p>
    Whether you are navigating on the road, geocaching, or looking up coordinates on our <a href="/tools/gps-coordinates/">GPS Coordinates Finder</a>, an inaccurate location reading can be frustrating. Modern smartphones possess GNSS chipsets capable of positional accuracy under 3 meters (10 feet), yet users frequently suffer errors of 50 to 500 meters.
  </p>
  <p>
    In this guide, our geospatial engineering team details the exact hardware calibration, operating system permissions, and radio environment adjustments to diagnose and maximize your device's location accuracy.
  </p>

  <div class="tool-callout">
    <div class="tool-callout-content">
      <span class="tool-callout-badge">🎯 Live Diagnostics</span>
      <h3 class="tool-callout-title">Test Your Current GPS Accuracy In Real-Time</h3>
